---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
---

<BaseLayout currentPath="/nosotros">
  <section class="hero-section relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-dark via-primary to-primary-dark overflow-hidden">
    <div class="hero-bg-image hero-bg-visible" style="background-image: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181406/pexels-photo-1181406.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1920')"></div>
    <div class="hero-pattern"></div>
    <div class="floating-shape floating-shape-1"></div>
    <div class="floating-shape floating-shape-2"></div>

    <!-- Logo watermark decorativo -->
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-[1] w-[28vw] h-[28vw] max-w-[400px] max-h-[400px] pointer-events-none select-none hidden lg:flex items-center justify-center opacity-[0.06]">
      <img src="/logo%20notaria%2080%20verde.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" aria-hidden="true">
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-32 pb-16">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="reveal mb-8">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 glass rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-cream text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">
            <i class="fas fa-users text-cream/70 text-xs"></i>
            Nuestra Historia
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-display text-cream reveal flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          <span class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-bold leading-[1.04] tracking-tight drop-shadow-xl">
            Sobre
          </span>
          <span class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-light italic text-cream/85 drop-shadow-lg">
            nosotros
          </span>
        </h1>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 my-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
          <span class="block w-12 h-px bg-cream/20"></span>
          <span class="block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-light/50"></span>
          <span class="block flex-1 h-px bg-cream/10"></span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-cream/55 max-w-xl leading-relaxed reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
          Conoce nuestra trayectoria y compromiso con la excelencia notarial.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── NUESTRO EQUIPO ── -->
  <section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="reveal-left">
          <div class="bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-sm border border-primary/15">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/5 to-transparent border border-primary/10 rounded-full text-primary text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4">
              <i class="fas fa-user-friends text-primary-light text-xs"></i>
              Nuestra Gente
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Nuestro Equipo</h2>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4">
              La Notaría Pública #80 de Guadalajara, bajo la titularidad de la Maestra María Enriqueta Ortiz Guerrero, se ha consolidado como una institución de confianza en el ámbito notarial jalisciense.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">
              Con más de una década de experiencia, ofrecemos servicios notariales especializados con el más alto nivel de profesionalismo, garantizando la seguridad jurídica que nuestros clientes merecen.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <span class="feature-chip inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/[0.06] to-primary/[0.02] rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-primary border border-primary/[0.08] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 cursor-default">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-light to-primary flex items-center justify-center text-cream text-[10px] shadow-sm shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i></span>
                Experiencia comprobada
              </span>
              <span class="feature-chip inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/[0.06] to-primary/[0.02] rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-primary border border-primary/[0.08] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 cursor-default">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-light to-primary flex items-center justify-center text-cream text-[10px] shadow-sm shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-user-friends"></i></span>
                Atención personalizada
              </span>
              <span class="feature-chip inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/[0.06] to-primary/[0.02] rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-primary border border-primary/[0.08] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 cursor-default">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-light to-primary flex items-center justify-center text-cream text-[10px] shadow-sm shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-laptop-code"></i></span>
                Tecnología moderna
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-right">
          <div class="gallery-slider relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-primary/15">
            <div class="relative h-80 md:h-[500px]">
              <div class="gallery-slide active"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/5668858/pexels-photo-5668858.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Oficina de la Notaría" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
              <div class="gallery-slide"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181406/pexels-photo-1181406.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Equipo de trabajo" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
              <div class="gallery-slide"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/416320/pexels-photo-416320.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Documentos" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
              <div class="gallery-slide"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181263/pexels-photo-1181263.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Archivo" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
            </div>
            <button class="gallery-prev absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-11 h-11 bg-cream/90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg text-primary hover:bg-white transition-all z-10 cursor-pointer"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i></button>
            <button class="gallery-next absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-11 h-11 bg-cream/90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg text-primary hover:bg-white transition-all z-10 cursor-pointer"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i></button>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex gap-2 z-10">
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-primary scale-125 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cream/60 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cream/60 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cream/60 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Transición decorativa ── -->
  <div class="relative h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/10 to-transparent"></div>

  <!-- ── INSTALACIONES ── -->
  <section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-primary-dark to-primary relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="hero-pattern opacity-20"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="reveal-left order-2 md:order-1">
          <div class="gallery-slider relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/15">
            <div class="relative h-80 md:h-[500px]">
              <div class="gallery-slide active"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/416320/pexels-photo-416320.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Recepción" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
              <div class="gallery-slide"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181406/pexels-photo-1181406.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Sala de juntas" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
              <div class="gallery-slide"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181263/pexels-photo-1181263.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Oficina privada" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
              <div class="gallery-slide"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181298/pexels-photo-1181298.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Área de espera" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
              <div class="gallery-slide"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181677/pexels-photo-1181677.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Archivo digital" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer"></div>
            </div>
            <!-- Numeración editorial tipo Hafnia -->
            <div class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 text-[8rem] font-display font-black text-white/5 leading-none pointer-events-none select-none">01</div>
            <button class="gallery-prev absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-11 h-11 bg-cream/90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg text-primary hover:bg-white transition-all z-10 cursor-pointer"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i></button>
            <button class="gallery-next absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-11 h-11 bg-cream/90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg text-primary hover:bg-white transition-all z-10 cursor-pointer"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i></button>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex gap-2 z-10">
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-primary scale-125 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cream/60 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cream/60 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cream/60 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
              <button class="gallery-dot w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cream/60 transition-all cursor-pointer"></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal-right order-1 md:order-2">
          <div class="bg-white/[0.03] backdrop-blur-sm rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-sm border border-cream/20">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 border border-white/15 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full text-cream/90 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4">
              <i class="fas fa-building text-primary-light text-xs"></i>
              Nuestro Entorno
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-cream mb-6">Nuestras Instalaciones</h2>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream/80 mb-4">
              Contamos con modernas instalaciones diseñadas para brindar un ambiente profesional y cómodo a nuestros clientes. Nuestras oficinas están estratégicamente ubicadas en el corazón de Guadalajara, con fácil acceso y estacionamiento disponible.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream/80 mb-8">
              Cada espacio ha sido cuidadosamente diseñado para garantizar la privacidad y confidencialidad que requieren los actos notariales, contando con la tecnología más avanzada para agilizar los procesos.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <span class="feature-chip inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white/[0.05] rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-cream/90 border border-white/[0.08] backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 cursor-default">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-light to-primary flex items-center justify-center text-cream text-[10px] shadow-sm shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-door-open"></i></span>
                Salas privadas
              </span>
              <span class="feature-chip inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white/[0.05] rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-cream/90 border border-white/[0.08] backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 cursor-default">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-light to-primary flex items-center justify-center text-cream text-[10px] shadow-sm shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-microchip"></i></span>
                Tecnología avanzada
              </span>
              <span class="feature-chip inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white/[0.05] rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-cream/90 border border-white/[0.08] backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 cursor-default">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-light to-primary flex items-center justify-center text-cream text-[10px] shadow-sm shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-parking"></i></span>
                Estacionamiento
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── VALORES INSTITUCIONALES ── (nueva sección — overhaul T-019) -->
  <section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-primary-dark relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181722/pexels-photo-1181722.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1920')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-15"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
        <span class="text-primary-light text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 block">Nuestra Esencia</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-cream mb-4">Valores Institucionales</h2>
        <p class="text-cream/60 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed mt-3">Principios que definen nuestra forma de trabajar y relacionarnos con cada cliente que confía en nosotros.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 stagger-children">
        <div class="value-card glass-dark rounded-2xl p-7 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-md group">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap-outline mx-auto mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-500">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="block text-lg font-display font-bold text-cream mb-2">Integridad</span>
          <p class="text-cream/65 text-sm leading-relaxed">Actuamos con honestidad y transparencia en cada acción notarial.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card glass-dark rounded-2xl p-7 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-md group">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap-outline mx-auto mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-500">
            <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="block text-lg font-display font-bold text-cream mb-2">Confianza</span>
          <p class="text-cream/65 text-sm leading-relaxed">Construimos relaciones duraderas basadas en la certeza jurídica.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card glass-dark rounded-2xl p-7 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-md group">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap-outline mx-auto mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-500">
            <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="block text-lg font-display font-bold text-cream mb-2">Excelencia</span>
          <p class="text-cream/65 text-sm leading-relaxed">Buscamos la más alta calidad en cada servicio que ofrecemos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card glass-dark rounded-2xl p-7 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-md group">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap-outline mx-auto mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-500">
            <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="block text-lg font-display font-bold text-cream mb-2">Servicio</span>
          <p class="text-cream/65 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ponemos a las personas en el centro de nuestra labor notarial.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card glass-dark rounded-2xl p-7 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-md group">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap-outline mx-auto mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-500">
            <i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="block text-lg font-display font-bold text-cream mb-2">Innovación</span>
          <p class="text-cream/65 text-sm leading-relaxed">Incorporamos tecnología para hacer más ágil cada trámite.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card glass-dark rounded-2xl p-7 text-center hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-md group">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap-outline mx-auto mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-500">
            <i class="fas fa-balance-scale"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="block text-lg font-display font-bold text-cream mb-2">Justicia</span>
          <p class="text-cream/65 text-sm leading-relaxed">Garantizamos imparcialidad y equidad en todos los actos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── TITULAR ── -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32 bg-cream overflow-x-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 lg:mb-16 reveal">
        <span class="text-primary-light text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 block">Titular</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">Nuestra Titular</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
        <!-- Photo / Sidebar -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 reveal-left lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start">
          <div class="glass-green rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 text-center">
            <div class="w-20 sm:w-28 md:w-32 h-20 sm:h-28 md:h-32 mx-auto mb-4 sm:mb-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-light to-primary-dark flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl ring-2 ring-cream/10">
              <i class="fas fa-user-tie text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-cream"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-cream leading-tight">Maestra María Enriqueta Ortiz Guerrero</h3>
            <p class="text-cream/70 font-semibold mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base">Notaria Pública Titular #80</p>
            <div class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 pt-4 sm:pt-6 border-t border-cream/10 space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center items-start gap-1 p-2.5 sm:p-3 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-cream/15">
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cream/70">Cédula Federal</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-cream bg-white/15 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cream/20 text-xs sm:text-sm">2393029</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center items-start gap-1 p-2.5 sm:p-3 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-cream/15">
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cream/70">Cédula Estatal</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-cream bg-white/15 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cream/20 text-xs sm:text-sm">110366</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/523311704104" target="_blank" class="btn-primary px-5 sm:px-6 py-2.5 sm:py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mt-4 shadow-lg w-full text-sm sm:text-base">
              <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Contactar
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CV Tabs -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-3 reveal-right min-w-0">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-primary-dark to-primary rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl border border-cream/12">
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream/85 mb-5 sm:mb-6 md:mb-8">
            La Maestra María Enriqueta Ortiz Guerrero es una distinguida profesional del derecho con más de 30 años de experiencia en el ámbito jurídico. Desde marzo de 2013, se desempeña como Notaria Pública Titular de la Notaría 80 de Guadalajara, brindando servicios notariales de la más alta calidad y seguridad jurídica.
          </p>

          <div class="cv-tabs">
            <div class="flex max-sm:gap-0.5 gap-1 overflow-x-auto pb-0 border-b-2 border-cream/15 scrollbar-hide">
              <button class="cv-tab-btn active flex items-center max-sm:gap-1 gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 max-sm:px-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3 md:px-5 max-sm:py-1.5 py-2 sm:py-2.5 md:py-3 rounded-t-xl max-sm:text-[11px] text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap" data-tab="formacion">
                <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap hidden sm:inline"></i> Formación
              </button>
              <button class="cv-tab-btn flex items-center max-sm:gap-1 gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 max-sm:px-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3 md:px-5 max-sm:py-1.5 py-2 sm:py-2.5 md:py-3 rounded-t-xl max-sm:text-[11px] text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap text-cream/60 hover:text-cream hover:bg-white/10" data-tab="experiencia">
                <i class="fas fa-briefcase hidden sm:inline"></i> Experiencia
              </button>
              <button class="cv-tab-btn flex items-center max-sm:gap-1 gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 max-sm:px-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3 md:px-5 max-sm:py-1.5 py-2 sm:py-2.5 md:py-3 rounded-t-xl max-sm:text-[11px] text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap text-cream/60 hover:text-cream hover:bg-white/10" data-tab="especializacion">
